"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1048d44b28527ff2\" href=\"?note=1048d44b28527ff2\" title=\"58-df-zfc-model7-premouse\">58-df-zfc-model7-premouse</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"58-df-countable\">58-df-countable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"58-df-elementary-embedding\">58-df-elementary-embedding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterablePremouse}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterablePremouse}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3ea3dede2645310a\" href=\"?note=3ea3dede2645310a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-model7-iterable-premouse\">58-df-zfc-model7-iterable-premouse</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerCountableIterability}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerCountableIterability}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}countable\\text{-}iterability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerCountableIterability}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S(M)\\land\n\\forall N,\\pi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S(N)\\land\n\\mathrm{Countable}_S(N)\\land\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(\\pi,N,M)\n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterablePremouse}_S(N)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}countable\\text{-}iterability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerCountableIterability}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S(M)\\land\n\\forall N,\\pi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S(N)\\land\n\\mathrm{Countable}_S(N)\\land\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(\\pi,N,M)\n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterablePremouse}_S(N)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every countable premouse that elementarily embeds into <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> must satisfy the repository's canonical iterability predicate; the former undeclared ternary strategy predicate is eliminated.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-countable","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-countable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-elementary-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-elementary-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-model7-iterable-premouse","status":"resolved","id":"3ea3dede2645310a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-model7-iterable-premouse]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-model7-premouse","status":"resolved","id":"1048d44b28527ff2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-model7-premouse]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-model7-premouse","status":"resolved","id":"1048d44b28527ff2","anchor":"ref